{"3852610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lost viking somewhere in Byzantine Empire.", "steam_appid": 3852610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LOST VIKING: SOMEWHERE IN BYZANTINE EMPIRE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Lost Viking</i> is a fantasy retro &quot;hero simulator&quot; set in an alternate history where the Earth is divided among warring gods. The <strong>Norse, Greek, Egyptian, and Celtic pantheons</strong> vie for dominance, carving the world into rival empires. You play as the second son of a Viking Jarl, sent to the ruins of the Byzantine Empire—a territory seized by Northmen—to prove your worth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The conquered palace guards the <strong>Valknut</strong>, Odin's legendary artifact. You are not armed with it, but you can channel its power like other challengers. Through your father's influence and gold, you acquire <strong>Valknut Gems</strong>. These mystical stones allow you to cheat death—if you fall in battle, a gem is consumed to rewind time and resurrect you at the last checkpoint.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⚔️ Hybrid Combat System:</strong> Master the blade in third-person mode or switch to <strong>FPS view</strong> for precision strikes. Utilize 3 different attack types and combat tricks to defeat Goblins, Jottuns, and dangerous beasts or rival warriors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌲 Yggdrasil Skill Tree:</strong> Your hero starts slow, but destiny awaits. Level up to unlock perks in the Skill Tree. Increase your speed, agility, and learn powerful magic abilities or handy skills like the <strong>Hunter</strong> ability to scavenge food from prey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🛡️ Survival &amp; RPG Elements:</strong> It’s not just about fighting. Manage your <strong>Hunger</strong> system with food, collect loot, and rest at checkpoints to recover Health and Magic Energy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🗣️ Diplomacy &amp; Choices:</strong> Violence isn't always the answer. Use the <strong>Diplomacy skill</strong> to negotiate with humanoid enemies or uncover lore through dialogues with unique NPCs like Ratatoskr the guide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>☠️ Hardcore Challenge:</strong> Choose your difficulty from &quot;Chicken&quot; to &quot;Godlike&quot;, which directly impacts your starting lives and enemy density.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>📊 Retro Aesthetics:</strong> Experience a stylized world with old-school vibes, complete with score leaderboards, secrets to find, and a unique physics-based movement system.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LOST VIKING: SOMEWHERE IN BYZANTINE EMPIRE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Lost Viking</i> is a fantasy retro &quot;hero simulator&quot; set in an alternate history where the Earth is divided among warring gods. The <strong>Norse, Greek, Egyptian, and Celtic pantheons</strong> vie for dominance, carving the world into rival empires. You play as the second son of a Viking Jarl, sent to the ruins of the Byzantine Empire—a territory seized by Northmen—to prove your worth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The conquered palace guards the <strong>Valknut</strong>, Odin's legendary artifact. You are not armed with it, but you can channel its power like other challengers. Through your father's influence and gold, you acquire <strong>Valknut Gems</strong>. These mystical stones allow you to cheat death—if you fall in battle, a gem is consumed to rewind time and resurrect you at the last checkpoint.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⚔️ Hybrid Combat System:</strong> Master the blade in third-person mode or switch to <strong>FPS view</strong> for precision strikes. Utilize 3 different attack types and combat tricks to defeat Goblins, Jottuns, and dangerous beasts or rival warriors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌲 Yggdrasil Skill Tree:</strong> Your hero starts slow, but destiny awaits. Level up to unlock perks in the Skill Tree. Increase your speed, agility, and learn powerful magic abilities or handy skills like the <strong>Hunter</strong> ability to scavenge food from prey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🛡️ Survival &amp; RPG Elements:</strong> It’s not just about fighting. Manage your <strong>Hunger</strong> system with food, collect loot, and rest at checkpoints to recover Health and Magic Energy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🗣️ Diplomacy &amp; Choices:</strong> Violence isn't always the answer. Use the <strong>Diplomacy skill</strong> to negotiate with humanoid enemies or uncover lore through dialogues with unique NPCs like Ratatoskr the guide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>☠️ Hardcore Challenge:</strong> Choose your difficulty from &quot;Chicken&quot; to &quot;Godlike&quot;, which directly impacts your starting lives and enemy density.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>📊 Retro Aesthetics:</strong> Experience a stylized world with old-school vibes, complete with score leaderboards, secrets to find, and a unique physics-based movement system.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Enter an alternate history where Vikings rule the Byzantine Empire. In this retro hero simulator, master sword &amp; magic, manage hunger, and use the Valknut artifact to cheat death. Fight through a world torn apart by warring gods to prove your destiny.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852610/f91c8bba708345dcf2a4cf923bda8c92fc2a1746/header.jpg?t=1781603228", "capsule_image": "https://sh